sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant SW as Service Worker (PWA)
    participant W as Worker /api/*
    participant D1 as Cloudflare D1

    U->>SW: opens maria.liberada.net (first visit)
    SW->>W: GET /api/subdomain?user=maria
    W->>D1: SELECT username · key · aliases
    alt exists
        D1-->>W: profile + author key
        W-->>SW: 200 { profile, clips }
        SW-->>U: renders aggregator profile
    else doesn't exist
        D1-->>W: 404 (profile not created)
        W-->>SW: 404 { available: true }
        SW-->>U: "🌐 free — create your profile" (CTA)
    end